    "q_en": "What amount is to be repaid on a loan of ₹17,000 for one year at 12% per annum compounded half yearly?",
    "q_hi": "₹17,000 के ऋण पर एक वर्ष के लिए 12% प्रति वर्ष की दर से अर्धवार्षिक रूप से संयोजित होने वाली राशि क्या है?",
    "section": "Arithmetic",
    "solution": "1. Principal (P) = ₹17,000.\n2. Annual Rate = 12%. For half-yearly compounding, Rate (R) = 12/2 = 6% per half-year.\n3. Time = 1 year. Number of periods (n) = 2 half-years.\n4. Amount (A) = P(1 + R/100)ⁿ = 17,000(1 + 6/100)².\n5. A = 17,000 × (1.06) × (1.06) = 17,000 × 1.1236 = ₹19,101.20.<br><br>1. मूलधन (P) = ₹17,000.\n2. वार्षिक दर = 12%. अर्धवार्षिक संयोजन के लिए, दर (R) = 12/2 = 6% प्रति अर्धवर्ष।\n3. समय = 1 वर्ष। अवधियों की संख्या (n) = 2 अर्धवर्ष।\n4. मिश्रधन (A) = P(1 + R/100)ⁿ = 17,000(1 + 6/100)².\n5. A = 17,000 × 1.06 × 1.06 = ₹19,101.20.<br><br><b>Short Trick:</b> Effective Rate for 2 cycles of 6% = 6 + 6 + (6×6/100) = 12.36%. Amount = 17000 + 12.36% of 17000 = 17000 + 2101.2 = ₹19,101.20.",
    "topic": "Compound Interest"
  },
