    "q_en": "A sum when invested at the rate of 10% simple interest per annum amounts to ₹10,500 after 2 years. The simple interest (in ₹) for the given time period is:<span style=\"color: white;\">725</span>",
    "q_hi": "एक राशि जब 10% प्रति वर्ष साधारण ब्याज की दर से निवेश की जाती है, तो 2 वर्ष बाद ₹10,500 हो जाती है। दी गई समयावधि के लिए साधारण ब्याज (₹ में) है:",
    "section": "Arithmetic",
    "solution": "1. Rate (R) = 10%, Time (T) = 2 years. Total SI % = R × T = 10% × 2 = 20%.\n2. Amount % = Principal % + SI % = 100% + 20% = 120%.\n3. Given, 120% = ₹10,500.\n4. Principal = (10500 / 120) × 100 = ₹8,750.\n5. Simple Interest = Amount - Principal = 10,500 - 8,750 = ₹1,750.<br><br>1. दर (R) = 10%, समय (T) = 2 वर्ष। कुल ब्याज % = 10% × 2 = 20%.\n2. मिश्रधन % = मूलधन + ब्याज = 100% + 20% = 120%.\n3. दिया गया है, 120% = ₹10,500.\n4. मूलधन = (10500 / 120) × 100 = ₹8,750.\n5. साधारण ब्याज = मिश्रधन - मूलधन = 10,500 - 8,750 = ₹1,750.<br><br><b>Short Trick:</b> 120% = 10500. Interest is 20%. 20% = 10500 / 6 = ₹1,750.",
    "topic": "Simple Interest"
