    "q_en": "The price of a suit was ₹8,000, and it is now ₹9,500. What is the percentage increase in the suit's price?",
    "q_hi": "एक सूट की कीमत ₹8,000 थी, और अब यह ₹9,500 है। सूट की कीमत में प्रतिशत वृद्धि क्या है?",
    "section": "Arithmetic",
    "solution": "1. Initial Price = ₹8,000.\n2. New Price = ₹9,500.\n3. Increase in price = 9,500 - 8,000 = ₹1,500.\n4. Percentage increase = (Increase / Initial Price) × 100.\n5. % Increase = (1500 / 8000) × 100 = 18.75%.<br><br>1. प्रारंभिक मूल्य = ₹8,000.\n2. नया मूल्य = ₹9,500.\n3. मूल्य में वृद्धि = 9,500 - 8,000 = ₹1,500.\n4. प्रतिशत वृद्धि = (वृद्धि / प्रारंभिक मूल्य) × 100.\n5. % वृद्धि = (1500 / 8000) × 100 = 18.75%.<br><br><b>Short Trick:</b> Increase = 1500. % Increase = (1500 / 8000) × 100 = 18.75%.",
